<!--
  INDI PlotJuggler layout — SHARED SCHEMA (aircraft-agnostic, sim + real flight).

  All curves are keyed under the fixed root "/uav"; both telemetry sources are
  normalized into this schema by pj_json_relay.py (see plotjuggler_mfc.xml for
  the full schema notes). INDI-specific branches used here are the nps_scope
  registrations from stabilization_indi.c (indi/*), guidance_indi.c thrust-MFC
  loop (mfc/z_*), and the WLS allocator (WLS_U/WLS_V); TRUTH/EST/SENSORS/SP are
  the generic sim-state branches. Real-flight ivy parity for the indi/* branches
  does not exist yet — those plots are sim-only for now.
-->
